; the energy a photon IS.
; not energy that a photon has — the photon IS this energy.
; E = hf: the frequency of oscillation determines the energy entirely.
; no mass. no rest state. existence IS motion IS energy.
; the quantum is the irreducible unit — below this there is no half-photon.
; planck's constant h is the bridge between frequency (cycles per second)
; and energy (joules) — the conversion factor of the universe at this scale.

(kosha photon-energy
  (swarupa energy subanta)
  (yukta photon frequency planck-constant)
  (phala scalar)
  (vishesa quantum-varga))
